msgid "Lucid Dreams"
msgstr "清明夢"

msgid ""
"Shhh... you can see me? Few dreamers ever do. Two nightmares have broken "
"loose in this realm. While they roam, no dream is safe."
msgstr ""
"噓... 你能看見我？很少有做夢的人能做到。有兩個噩夢已經在這個領域裡"
"掙脫了束縛。當它們遊蕩時，沒有哪個夢是安全的。"

msgid "Listen to Whisp."
msgstr "傾聽低語"

msgid ""
"The nightmares feed on dreams, and I am made of little else. Bring me five "
"Fading Dreams from the walls of the Dream Castle so I can regain my strength."
msgstr ""
"噩夢以夢為食，而我幾乎全由夢構成。從夢之城堡的牆上給我帶五個"
"消逝之夢迴來，好讓我恢復力量。"

msgid "Mine five Fading Dreams from the Dream Castle and bring them to me."
msgstr "從夢之城堡開採五個消逝之夢，並把它們帶給我。"

msgid ""
"Ahh... I can remember again. The nightmares slipped into this realm through "
"a tear in the sky, from the cold void between the stars."
msgstr ""
"啊……我又能記起來了。那些噩夢是從天空中的一道裂口，"
"從群星之間冰冷的虛空裡溜進這個領域的。"

msgid "Bring the Fading Dreams to the Dream Whisp."
msgstr "把消逝之夢帶給夢語者"

msgid "Echoes of the Void"
msgstr "虛空迴響"

msgid ""
"Ordinary steel cannot cut a nightmare. A dream blade needs something from "
"the void they came from, and iron that fell from the stars."
msgstr ""
"普通鋼鐵斬不斷噩夢。夢之刃需要取自噩夢所來虛空的某種東西，"
"以及從天而降的鐵。"

msgid "Talk to the Dream Whisp."
msgstr "與夢語者交談。"

msgid ""
"Bring me three pieces of Dark Matter and five Meteorite Blocks. With them I "
"can follow the nightmares' trail and prepare the blade."
msgstr ""
"給我帶三塊暗物質和五塊隕石塊回來。有了它們，我就能追蹤噩夢的蹤跡，"
"並準備好那把劍刃。"

msgid ""
"Bring three pieces of Dark Matter and five Meteorite Blocks to the Dream "
"Whisp."
msgstr "把三塊暗物質和五塊隕石方塊帶給夢語者。"

msgid ""
"Cold... so cold. Yes, I can feel them now, hiding far out among the stars. "
"The star iron is ready. Only the nightmares remain."
msgstr ""
"冷……好冷。對，我現在能感覺到它們了，藏在遙遠的群星之間。"
"星鐵已經準備好了。只剩下噩夢了。"

msgid "Bring the Dark Matter and Meteorite Blocks to the Dream Whisp."
msgstr "把暗物質和隕石方塊帶給夢語者。"

msgid "End of Nightmares"
msgstr "噩夢終焉"

msgid ""
"Defeat Infelix Centrum and Orbis Felix, and I will teach you to forge a "
"blade from dreams themselves."
msgstr ""
"擊敗因費利克斯·森特魯姆和奧比斯·菲利克斯，我就教你用夢本身鍛造一把劍刃。"

msgid ""
"The nightmares still stalk this realm. Defeat Infelix Centrum and Orbis "
"Felix, then come back to me."
msgstr ""
"噩夢仍在這個領域中徘徊。擊敗因費利克斯·森特魯姆和奧比斯·菲利克斯，"
"然後回到我這裡。"

msgid "Tell the Dream Whisp that the nightmares are defeated."
msgstr "告訴夢語者噩夢已被擊敗。"

msgid "Sweet dreams, dreamer."
msgstr "好夢，做夢的人。"

msgid "Exp"
msgstr "經驗值"

msgid "The nightmares know you are coming. Infelix Centrum and Orbis Felix are waiting for you among the stars, they grew so big by feeding on Dreams."
msgstr "噩夢們知道你要來了。因費利克斯·森特魯姆和奧比斯·菲利克斯正在群星之間等著你，它們靠吞噬夢境長得如此巨大。"

msgid "The nightmares are gone and the realm sleeps peacefully again. As promised, here is the secret of the Lucid Dream. Dream Pillars for the handle and a Realm Crystal for its core."
msgstr "噩夢已經消失，領域再次安然沉睡。如約，這就是澄夢的秘密：用夢境柱做劍柄，用領域水晶做核心。"
